ody":"### Tested versions\n\nTested on `4.3-stable`.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.3-stable\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen checking for the presence of an `int` in a `PackedInt64Array`, the `in` operator always returns `false` if the operand is greater than `2147483647` (i.e. greater than the max signed `int32` value).\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nRun this simple block of GDScript code:\n\n```py\nvar value: int = 2147483647 # Maximum signed 'int32' value.\n\nvar arr := PackedInt64Array([value, value+1])\nassert(arr.has(value)) # OK\nassert(value in arr) # OK\n\nassert(arr.has(value+1)) # OK\nassert((value+1) in arr) # FAILS!\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100580/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100580/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}